<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2012/Ebenezer-Church-2-Study.jpg" alt="A landscape painting featuring a distant farm with gray sky" width="500" height="355" /></p>
<p>This is a study for a larger painting which is currently on display and for sale at Hillsborough Vineyards until the end of 2012.</p>
<p>Originally painted with a flat grey sky, I used the same technique as in the previous post and scumbled some light, warm grey into the sky around the center of interest. &nbsp;I used a mix of white, cobalt blue and cad orange, again with lots of medium.</p>